<section id="criteria" class="criteria">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>What We Look For</h2>
    <p>
      We're drawn to vertical B2B software companies: products built for a
      specific industry that run mission-critical workflows. The kind of
      business where your customers would have a really hard time replacing you.
    </p>
    <p>Here's what tends to get our attention:</p>
    <ul class="criteria-list">
      <li>Profitable and founder-led, with a real track record</li>
      <li>Recurring revenue and strong customer retention</li>
      <li>
        A durable niche that's not about to get disrupted by a well-funded
        competitor
      </li>
      <li>A team that wants to stay and keep building</li>
      <li>EBITDA between $250k–$1M</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We gravitate toward regulated, slow-moving verticals where switching costs
      are high and the customer base values reliability over the newest shiny
      thing.
    </p>
    <p>
      If your business doesn't check every box, reach out anyway. We'd rather
      have the conversation than miss something great over a technicality.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .criteria-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
